Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,Earth stops. Air doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.28,0:00:02.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,Inertia turns motion into
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.26,0:00:03.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,impact.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.24,0:00:04.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,Known physics says the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.58,0:00:05.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,mechanism is angular momentum,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.91,0:00:07.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,surface velocity and atmospheric
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.25,0:00:08.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,inertia.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.58,0:00:09.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,The best supported consequence
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.89,0:00:11.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,is this: the atmosphere,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.19,0:00:12.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,oceans and crust would
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.49,0:00:13.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,keep moving when the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.80,0:00:15.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,ground changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.10,0:00:16.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,The exact timeline depends
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.27,0:00:17.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,on how the impossible
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.45,0:00:18.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,change occurs.
